---
config:
  theme: redux-color
---
sequenceDiagram
    %% Participantes (IDs sem espaços para máxima compatibilidade)
    participant Cliente
    participant API
    participant Auth
    participant UserService
    participant OrderService
    participant OrderRepository
    participant RabbitMQ
    participant PaymentService
    participant PaymentRepository
    participant Worker

    %% Fluxo principal: criação de pedido (síncrono até persistência)
    Cliente->>API: POST orders payload + JWT
    API->>Auth: validate JWT
    Auth-->>API: 200 OK

    %% Validação de usuário (opcional)
    API->>UserService: GET users by id
    UserService-->>API: 200 User data

    %% Tentativa de criação do pedido
    API->>OrderService: CreateOrder command with user and items
    %% Validação e cálculos (sequencial para compatibilidade de renderizadores)
    OrderService->>OrderService: validate payload and business rules
    OrderService->>OrderService: calculate totals

    alt payload invalid
        OrderService-->>API: 400 Bad Request
        API-->>Cliente: 400 Bad Request
    else
        OrderService->>OrderRepository: INSERT order status PENDING
        OrderRepository-->>OrderService: order persisted id

        OrderService->>RabbitMQ: publish order.created.accepted event with orderId and userId
        OrderService-->>API: 201 Created orderId
        API-->>Cliente: 201 Created orderId
    end

    %% Processamento assíncrono: Payment Service processa pagamento
    Note over RabbitMQ,PaymentService: Event-Driven Payment Processing
    RabbitMQ->>PaymentService: order.created.accepted event
    PaymentService->>PaymentService: create payment with status PENDING
    PaymentService->>PaymentRepository: INSERT payment for orderId
    PaymentRepository-->>PaymentService: payment created id

    PaymentService->>PaymentService: simulate payment processing (90% success rate)

    alt payment successful
        PaymentService->>PaymentRepository: UPDATE payment status COMPLETED
        PaymentRepository-->>PaymentService: updated
        PaymentService->>RabbitMQ: publish payment.completed event with orderId

        Note over RabbitMQ,OrderService: Order reacts to payment success
        RabbitMQ->>OrderService: payment.completed event
        OrderService->>OrderRepository: UPDATE order status CONFIRMED
        OrderRepository-->>OrderService: updated
    else payment failed
        PaymentService->>PaymentRepository: UPDATE payment status FAILED
        PaymentRepository-->>PaymentService: updated
        PaymentService->>RabbitMQ: publish payment.failed event with orderId

        Note over RabbitMQ,OrderService: Order reacts to payment failure
        RabbitMQ->>OrderService: payment.failed event
        OrderService->>OrderRepository: UPDATE order status CANCELLED
        OrderRepository-->>OrderService: updated
    end

    %% Processamento adicional: worker reage aos eventos
    RabbitMQ->>Worker: OrderConfirmed and notifications
    Worker->>Worker: Send confirmation email and notifications

%% Observações:
%% - correlationId deve ser propagado para tracing e logs distribuídos.
%% - O gateway realiza autenticação e validação leve; lógica de domínio fica no OrderService.
%% - order.created.accepted é publicado de forma at-least-once; consumidores idempotentes devem ser usados.
%% - Payment Service implementa arquitetura event-driven: escuta ordem e publica eventos de pagamento.
%% - Order Service reage automaticamente a eventos de pagamento para atualizar status.
